  "body": "On The Esplanade, morning arrives not with an alarm but from fresh salt air and shifting rays of light across the Hauraki Gulf. This architecturally composed four-bedroom, three-bathroom sanctuary marries high-specification craft with smart-home intuition, framing coastal visuals from its sunlit ground-floor hearth to its breezy upper-level gallery and wraparound deck.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers quiet autonomy for guests or multigenerational families, with the upstairs providing a private dawn-breaking sanctuary that opens directly at daylight. Bordering Rogers Park and zoned for Macleans College, this residence transforms fleeting weekend reveries into everlasting memories.\r\n\r\nEnquire today to see if this haven is right for you.",
